ngth, and $\\ell = 4\\,a$.","caption":["The equatorial plane ($z = 0$) of Bonnor's dust cloud ($a = 1$) outside the closed null curve $\\rho = a$, with $\\phi$ left out, each point in the diagram a circle about the axis. Orthogonal to the circles the metric is $-c^2dt^2/(1 - a^4/\\rho^4) + e^{a^4/8\\rho^4}d\\rho^2$, whose rays are the null geodesics of no angular momentum, and with $\\rho_* = \\int_a^{\\rho} e^{a^4/16s^4}\\sqrt{1 - a^4/s^4}\\,ds$ the maps $p = \\arctan((ct - \\rho_*)/\\ell)$ and $q = \\arctan((ct + \\rho_*)/\\ell)$ bring it into Minkowski's triangle.","The edge $X = 0$ is $\\rho = a$, which such a ray reaches in a finite time $t$. Inside it the circles about the axis are closed timelike curves, and the plane with them divided out has no light cones."],"layers":[{"kind":"fill","class":"region","points":[[0.0,-3.1416],[3.1416,0.0],[0.0,3.1416]]},{"kind":"fill","class":"cover","points":[[0.0,-3.1416],[3.1416,0.0],[0.0,3.1416]]},{"kind":"line","class":"r","points":[[0.0,-3.1396],[0.0052,-2.8014],[0.0201,-2.4608],[0.0491,-2.0438],[0.1247,-1.1767],[0.1521,-0.812],[0.1733,-0.396],[0.1803,-0.0089],[0.1754,0.3313],[0.1593,0.6953],[0.1305,1.1062],[0.0574,1.9436],[0.0276,2.3384],[0.0069,2.7497],[0.0,3.1396]]},{"kind":"line","class":"r","points":[[0.0,-3.1396],[0.0031,-2.9689],[0.012,-2.801],[0.0257,-2.64],[0.0467,-2.4583],[0.0768,-2.2518],[0.1142,-2.0352],[0.2819,-1.1905],[0.3456,-0.8211],[0.3759,-0.5957],[0.3949,-0.405],[0.4075,-0.2039],[0.4118,-0.0086],[0.4095,0.149],[0.4012,0.3205],[0.3866,0.4964],[0.3661,0.6759],[0.336,0.8834],[0.3017,1.0836],[0.1268,1.9677],[0.064,2.3345],[0.0359,2.5453],[0.0158,2.7492],[0.0038,2.9493],[0.0,3.1396]]},{"kind":"line","class":"r","points":[[0.0,-3.1396],[0.0022,-3.0633],[0.0085,-2.9862],[0.0331,-2.8323],[0.0544,-2.7425],[0.0773,-2.6626],[0.1344,-2.4996],[0.2142,-2.3125],[0.3313,-2.0761],[0.463,-1.8349],[0.8378,-1.1753],[0.9407,-0.9799],[1.0371,-0.7775],[1.0858,-0.6618],[1.1239,-0.5599],[1.1533,-0.4701],[1.1805,-0.3721],[1.20